# InsightFace buffalo_l ONNX models are downloaded here automatically
# on first initialisation (~280 MB).
# Cached location: ~/.insightface/models/buffalo_l/
#   det_10g.onnx      — SCRFD face detection
#   w600k_r50.onnx    — ArcFace recognition (512-d embeddings)
#   genderage.onnx    — age / gender estimation
#   1k3d68.onnx       — 3-D facial landmarks
#   2d106det.onnx     — 2-D facial landmarks
